// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
//  A & I — "Style With Us"
//  Single-file luxury womenswear storefront.
//  Merges Home · Collection · Product · Lookbook · About + Cart into one App.
//
//  3D motion is built on the `css-3d-animations` skill:
//    • Magnetic tilt + glare   (product & feature cards)
//    • Flip cards              (The Craft section)
//    • Parallax depth layers   (hero + section accents)
//  All three respect `prefers-reduced-motion` (see usePrefersReducedMotion).
//
//  IMAGERY — every catalogue photo is embedded as a base64 data URL (see IMG),
//  so the file renders standalone with no external assets. Designs with several
//  photos auto-advance as a deck (dots to jump; respects reduced motion).
//  Per the revised deck, designs 4-9 have their options separated: Lavender
//  Lies splits into three (Lavender Lies / Too Glam To Care / Romance Ruined
//  Me) and Limoncello into two (Limoncello Drama / Tequila & Tantrums).
//  Missing/failed images fall back to a generated plate from the swatch color.
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

